 bosses</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342390/extras/b511c6648de536e955a108322d1acb61.poster.avif?t=1727943582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342390/extras/b511c6648de536e955a108322d1acb61.webm?t=1727943582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342390/extras/b511c6648de536e955a108322d1acb61.mp4?t=1727943582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
